<title>USA: Iowa-So Minn hogs actual Tuesday 95,000 - USDA.</title>
<headline>Iowa-So Minn hogs actual Tuesday 95,000 - USDA.</headline>
<dateline>DES MOINES 1997-05-21</dateline>
<text>
<p>Actual interior Iowa/southern Minnesota hog receipts Tuesday matched the estimate of 95,000 head, USDA reported. Opening trade not well established.  Early sales Barrows and Gilts were steady to instances $0.50 lower compared to midsession Tuesday.</p>
<p>				  Country		   Plants</p>
<p>US 1-3   46-49% Carcass Base Lean*</p>
<p>220-260 lbs	    56.50 -58.00	   57.50 -59.00</p>
<p>			   56.00 -58.50	   57.00 -59.50</p>
<p>Sows:  steady to weak.</p>
<p>US 1-3 300-450 lbs.  46.00 -48.00	   47.00 -49.00</p>
<p>450-500 lbs.	   48.00 -49.00	   48.00 -50.00</p>
<p>500 lbs. up	    50.00 -53.00	   50.00 -54.00</p>
<p>((Chicago newsdesk 312-408-8720))</p>
